            "\\end{center}\n",
            "\\caption{\\textbf{LongLoRA} closes the accuracy gap that between conventional LoRA and full fine-tuning, while still maintaining up to 1.8$\\times$ lower memory cost than full fine-tuning. Furthermore, LongLoRA improves the training speed of LoRA by up to 1.8$\\times$ with $S^2$-Attn. Llama2-7B are fine-tuned to various context lengths with Flash-Attention2~\\citep{flash-attention2} and DeepSpeed~\\citep{deepspeed} stage 2 and evaluated on the proof-pile~\\citep{proof-pile} test set in perplexity.}\n",
